  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Enhancing resilience of the Burundian population to climate-induced hazards via an effective usage of disaster risk management infomation and data</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This 12-months project will contribute to enhancing the resilience of the Burundian population to climate-induced hazards via an effective usage of disaster risk management information and data. This will be achieved through providing open access a mutli-hazard risk information platform via a Cloud Server, defining national standards for disaster risk information and strengthening capacity to facilitate interaction and management of the risk information portal.</narrative>
  </description>
